event ball_start     0x25
event ball_end       0x34
event bonus_start    0x27
event bonus_end      0x28
event tilt_warning   0xc8
event tilt           0xc6
event game_over      0x47

# ---- callouts, heard in the emulator 2026-09-24 (item 163): the runtime's callout / callout_nth
